ASoC: FullIO: implement the guarded Denali reference paired START

Run the exact START table with graph, clocks-off and per-amplifier transport/epoch proofs.
Only enable VI/CPS clocks after both PA transitions. Contain either partial START with both reference STOPs.
Per-amp digital unmute defers PA-on to the card coordinator; readiness accepts Golden 0x2f and silent 0x2a.
